  "goodToKnow": "Das Nachschlagewerk is a reference work: Lexikon, Wörterbuch, Atlas. Nachschlagen means to look up: im Duden nachschlagen. The Brockhaus was Germany's great printed encyclopedia for two centuries until online sources took over; its last full print edition appeared in 2005–06. Synonyms: das Handbuch, das Standardwerk. Plural: die Nachschlagewerke."
